<title>SOUTH KOREA: Doosan Food buys 52,000T of corn.</title>
<headline>Doosan Food buys 52,000T of corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Doosan Food Co Ltd bought 52,000 tonnes of corn late last week at $160.40 per tonne on a cost and freight basis, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
